# {project_name} QA Policy

QA and deployment are separate requests.

## Method Choice

- Use static verification when tests, typechecks, builds, or diff review are
  enough.
- Use runtime QA when UI, navigation, integration, auth, browser, device,
  simulator, or production behavior is hard to trust statically.
- Report method, evidence, untested surfaces, and blockers.

## Gates

Use `SLICES.md` and repo-local instructions for required gates.
